> Jomsom Muktinath Trek[ is an] exciting trek[ in] the[ Ann]ap[urn]a and Mustang regions[ of] Nepal. The 13-day trek begins[ from] Kathmandu with the tour of UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Next, we fly[ to] Pokhara, the[ beautiful Lake] City and begin trekking from there. We trek in the beautiful[ Ann]ap[urn]a region and gradually enter the Mustang region.
